<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n3751" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀκτίς</span></b>  (nom. <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀκτίν</span></b>  Hdn.Gr.<i><span class="en">
			2.511
		</span></i>), [<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ῑ] ῖνος, ἡ</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>ray,
			beam</i> : <i><span class="en">
				Hom.
			</span></i> only dat. pl., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀκτῖσιν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Od.
					5.479
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				19.441
			</span></i>. 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀκτίνεσσιν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					11.16
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Il.
				10.547
			</span></i> ; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Ἠελίοιο ἀκτῖνες</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Mimn.
					11.6
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Emp.
				84
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Av.</u>
				1009
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>Mete.</u>
				374b4
			</span></i>, etc.; sg., <i><span class="en">
				S.
				<u>Tr.</u>
				685
			</span></i>, cf. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀνὰ μέσσαν ἀκτῖνα</span>,
			i.e. from south, <i><span class="en">
				S.
				<u>OC</u>
				1247
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀκτῖνες μέσαι</span>
			<i>noonday</i>, <i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>Ion</u>
				1136
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὰ πρὸς ἀκτῖνα ἔθνη</span>
			peoples of the <u>East</u>, <i><span class="en">
				Philostr.
			</span></i>
			<i>V A</i><i><span class="en">
				2.2
			</span></i> :— of lightning, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀκτῖνες στεροπᾶς ἀπορηγνύμεναι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pi.
					<u>P.</u>
					4.198
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὦ Διὸς ἀκτίς, παῖσον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					S.
					<u>Tr.</u>
					10
				</span></i>
			&lt;*&gt;<i><span class="en">
				6
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πυρός</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Sopat.
					13
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Ti.</u>
				78d
			</span></i>; of the eyes, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀκτῖνας
			προσώπου</span>, <i><span class="en">
				Pi.
				<u>Fr.</u>
				123
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>V.</u>
				1032
			</span></i>; visual <i>rays</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hipparch.
			</span></i> ap. <i><span class="en">
				<u>Placit.</u>
				4.13.9
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> metaph.,
				<i>brightness, splendour, glory</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀ.
				ἀγώνων, καλῶν ἐργμάτων</span>, <i><span class="en">
				Pi.
				<u>P.</u>
				11.48
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>I.</u>
				4(3).42
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀκτῖνες ὄλβου</span>
			<i>splendid</i> fortunes, <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>P.</u>
				4.255
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			<i>ray shot from the left by planet to planet</i> (opp. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὄψις</span>, q.v.), <i><span class="en">
				Heph.Astr.
				1.16
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Porph.
				<u>Intr.</u>
				p.189
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὴν ἀ. ἐπιφέρων</span> Vett.
			Val. <i><span class="en">
				136.19
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Ptol.
				<u>Tetr.</u>
				126
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>spoke</i> of a wheel, <i><span class="en">
				<u>AP</u>
				9.418
			</span></i> (Antip.).</div>
